! 
! problem type definition
! 
!Single-Piston   ! Single-Piston
ICEN   ! Internal Combustion Engine
SIKN 2   ! Active Chemistry Zones
TRAN   ! Transient Solver
! 
! physical property
! 
! START_DURATION   ! Specify Start-Duration
! WIEBE   ! Use Wiebe Function For Burn Profile
!4STR   ! Four Stroke
!No_Gas-Velocity_Correlation   ! No Gas-Velocity Correlation
!Ratios   ! Length Ratios
!Use_Ideal_Gas_Law   ! Use Ideal Gas Law
!Use_Power_Law_for_Viscosity   ! Use Power Law for Viscosity and Thermal Conductivity
BDUR 45.6   ! Burn Duration (degrees)
BEFF 1.0   ! Burn Efficiency
BINI -14.5   ! Start of Combustion (degrees)
BORE 8.5   ! Bore (cm)
EQMN 1.0E-14   ! Minimum Species Fraction (mole fraction)
EQRX   ! Use Equilibrium Product Estimation
HVAL 0.0   ! Fuel Heating Value (erg/g)
MLMT 1.0E-6   ! Minimum Zone Mass (g)
PRES 1.0   ! Pressure (atm)
QRGEQ   ! Integrate Heat Release by Gas-phase Reactions
STRK 10.82   ! Stroke (cm)
TEMP 353.0   ! Temperature (K)
WBFB 5.0   ! Wiebe Function b
WBFN 2.0   ! Wiebe Function n
! 
! reactor dimension definition
! 
CMPR 12.0   ! Engine Compression Ratio
DEG0 -120.2   ! Starting Crank Angle (ATDC) (degrees)
DEGE 139.8   ! End of Simulation Crank Angle (degrees)
LOLR 3.3   ! Connecting Rod to Crank Radius Ratio
RPM 600.0   ! Engine Speed (rpm)
! 
! species property
! 
XEST c2h5oh 0.0335362907123   ! Initial Gas Fraction (mole fraction)
XEST n2 0.7635063303373   ! Initial Gas Fraction (mole fraction)
XEST o2 0.2029573789504   ! Initial Gas Fraction (mole fraction)
! 
! solver control
! 
ADAP   ! Save Additional Adaptive Points
! 
! output control and other misc. property
! 
IEEE_CHECK_USUAL 0   ! Disable Over/Underflow Check
GFAC 1.0 1   ! Gas Reaction Rate Multiplier
GFAC 1.0 2   ! Gas Reaction Rate Multiplier
END
